1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:03,730
<i>I've always been drawn to beautiful things.</i>

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:07,160
So how do you solve this equation?

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,670
<i>Rainbows sparkling after the rain.</i>

4
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:10,200
<i>Coming-of-age movies 
about friendship and romance.</i>

5
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:10,220
First, you add the two equations, 
which cancels out "y."

6
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:12,110
Middle School
 Mathematics

7
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:14,570
<i>But even these don't come close 
to the beauty of flowers.</i>

8
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,990
<i>One day, when I have my own store,</i>

9
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:20,920
<i>I want to grow my own flowers.</i>

10
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,560
<i>Making flower accessories is
how I bring my passion to life.</i>

11
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:28,500
Middle School
 Mathematics

12
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:29,340
Shoot.

13
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:33,380
Yu! Let's eat lunch!

14
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:36,440
What're you in a hurry for?

15
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:41,060
Lemme guess, you couldn't wait to see me?

16
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,390
You like me way too much!

17
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:08,500
Can a Boy-Girl Friendship Survive?

18
00:01:07,370 --> 00:01:08,500
(No, It Can't!!)

19
00:02:16,570 --> 00:02:21,030
A Hunk and Morning Glory Yukata

20
00:02:17,150 --> 00:02:18,390
H-Hey, so...

21
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:22,160
I was thinking of eating by myself tod—

22
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:25,410
Drink up!

23
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:28,330
<i>Pressuring me in silence.</i>

24
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:31,320
<i>"The world's cutest girl came to find you."</i>

25
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:33,690
<i>"Stop moping around and let's get going."</i>

26
00:02:33,690 --> 00:02:34,510
<i>Something like that.</i>

27
00:02:35,190 --> 00:02:36,730
<i>I'll admit, she is cute.</i>

28
00:02:36,730 --> 00:02:38,250
Yo, Himari!

29
00:02:38,620 --> 00:02:40,320
Let's eat together for a change.

30
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:43,330
Wait, you're still hanging out with him?

31
00:02:43,330 --> 00:02:45,720
Don't you get tired of that loser?

32
00:02:46,710 --> 00:02:47,930
You'd be surprised!

33
00:02:47,930 --> 00:02:49,690
Yu's actually super smooth!

34
00:02:49,820 --> 00:02:51,530
<i>Yeah,</i> right<i>.</i>

35
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:52,640
We're going to karaoke after school.

36
00:02:52,970 --> 00:02:54,880
You should come.

37
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:59,160
As much as I'd love to belt it out, I dunno.

38
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:01,790
You <i>did</i> send me those messages yesterday.

39
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:03,840
Excuse me? What messages?

40
00:03:02,690 --> 00:03:03,800
I can explain!

41
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:04,280
Let's go, Yu!

42
00:03:04,610 --> 00:03:06,240
H-Hey, Himari!

43
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:12,280
So... I've been meaning to ask you.

44
00:03:12,910 --> 00:03:15,030
You've been avoiding me lately, haven't you?

45
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,830
I-I dunno what you're talking about.

46
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:21,340
Come on, spill.

47
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:23,310
F-Fine. You win!

48
00:03:23,310 --> 00:03:25,550
What is it? Did I do something?

49
00:03:25,550 --> 00:03:27,870
You haven't done anything!

50
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:29,230
Then why?

51
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,270
U-Um...

52
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:36,230
Himari-san, there's this 
thing called "class."

53
00:03:36,710 --> 00:03:37,720
What do you mean?

54
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:38,830
You know, um...

55
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:43,040
You're too nice, Yu.

56
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:44,990
Don't pay attention to those guys.

57
00:03:44,990 --> 00:03:46,820
You don't even know them.

58
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:50,990
You knew the other guys were bad-mouthing me?

59
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,660
They bug me about it, too.

60
00:03:54,110 --> 00:03:56,160
Did they tell you to 
stop hanging out with me?

61
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:59,500
They say you're out of my league.

62
00:04:00,890 --> 00:04:03,180
And why would you care what they think?

63
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,880
Well I can't just ignore it.

64
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:08,210
Besides, you have your friends...

65
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:11,120
in the popular crowd.

66
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,850
I don't want to hold you back.

67
00:04:13,850 --> 00:04:16,390
Here, look. It's from that guy back there.

68
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:19,190
Himari, will you go out with me?

69
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:20,150
I like you a lot.

70
00:04:17,530 --> 00:04:20,150
He's been at it for a month now.

71
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:20,150
Seriously.

72
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:20,150
I'll break up with my girlfriend.

73
00:04:21,420 --> 00:04:23,050
And this is from his girlfriend.

74
00:04:23,650 --> 00:04:27,560
She thinks I've been trying 
to steal him from her.

75
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,820
Jeez...

76
00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:31,080
Dating's no joke.

77
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:34,010
I'm tired of getting dragged 
into it, you know?

78
00:04:35,730 --> 00:04:37,050
That was a good lunch.

79
00:04:37,550 --> 00:04:40,080
Anyways, my point is...

80
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,500
You may think the popular crowd's

81
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:45,630
friendship and romance 
is this grand, beautiful thing.

82
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:51,060
But "beautiful" doesn't always mean "pure."

83
00:04:51,770 --> 00:04:55,680
I'd rather have things 
be pure, not beautiful.

84
00:04:56,280 --> 00:05:00,950
That's why I like how genuine 
your eyes get when you work.

85
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:04,700
Your passion isn't beneath me at all.

86
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:08,200
So promise me, you'll be 
my best friend forever.

87
00:05:08,690 --> 00:05:11,570
And that you'll never fall for me.

88
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,260
Well, duh.

89
00:05:15,660 --> 00:05:17,730
I'm your...

90
00:05:17,730 --> 00:05:20,540
b-best friend, after all.

91
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,860
Gotcha.

92
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:31,500
<i>I'm your... b-best friend, after all.</i>

93
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:32,520
Himari!

94
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,070
Bwa-ha!

95
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:36,360
You suck! Delete that!

96
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,450
I don't think so!

97
00:05:37,450 --> 00:05:38,840
Get back here!

98
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:46,250
How about this?

99
00:05:46,250 --> 00:05:48,010
From now on, when guys come on to me,

100
00:05:48,010 --> 00:05:50,150
I'll tell them that we're dating.

101
00:05:50,150 --> 00:05:53,080
Don't drag me into 
the popular crowd's feuds.

102
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:55,650
I don't need any more crap from those guys.

103
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:57,930
Besides, what if they believe you?

104
00:05:59,470 --> 00:06:01,730
Then wanna actually go out?

105
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:04,120
No way.

106
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,610
The last thing I'd want 
is to go out with you.

107
00:06:06,610 --> 00:06:07,850
Bwa-ha!

108
00:06:07,850 --> 00:06:10,120
See, you know me too well.

109
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:12,010
Cool, thanks.

110
00:06:12,220 --> 00:06:13,840
We should go back like this.

111
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,890
Come on, let's go!

112
00:06:16,890 --> 00:06:18,180
W-Wait!

113
00:06:17,570 --> 00:06:20,110
<i>Two years later, spring of junior year...</i>

114
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:20,100
Himari, your lunch!

115
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:21,610
Whoops, my bad!

116
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:24,970
<i>I ended up falling for Himari.</i>

117
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:32,710
<i>Apparently, Himari's not 
going to Tokyo anymore.</i>

118
00:06:32,890 --> 00:06:36,420
<i>And I totally missed my chance 
to tell her how I feel.</i>

119
00:06:37,030 --> 00:06:39,410
<i>I just need to play it cool.</i>

120
00:06:39,410 --> 00:06:42,880
Hey, Yu! Morning!

121
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:49,000
'Sup, Himari? Morning.

122
00:06:49,210 --> 00:06:51,820
Ew, what's with the creepy smile?

123
00:06:51,820 --> 00:06:53,560
You have a stomach ache or something?

124
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,950
Don't be a hater.

125
00:06:54,950 --> 00:06:56,800
That was a hunky smile.

126
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:58,650
I dunno about hunky.

127
00:06:58,650 --> 00:07:01,890
Kinda looked like you had an upset stomach.

128
00:07:01,890 --> 00:07:03,480
Whatever.

129
00:07:06,460 --> 00:07:08,340
Where's your ring?

130
00:07:09,140 --> 00:07:10,580
Oh, that? Right here.

131
00:07:11,450 --> 00:07:15,500
I figured wearing a ring 
to school might be a bit much.

132
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:16,600
Yeah, true.

133
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:19,410
Hey, want me to replace that belt?

134
00:07:19,990 --> 00:07:21,870
Nope, I like this one.

135
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:24,510
It's the first piece you ever gave me.

136
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,420
C-Cool.

137
00:07:28,060 --> 00:07:29,150
<i>I was this close to saying,</i>

138
00:07:29,150 --> 00:07:32,310
<i>"You're so cute I could die, and I love you."</i>

139
00:07:32,790 --> 00:07:36,200
<i>Good thing her cheesy 
line snapped me out of it.</i>

140
00:07:37,050 --> 00:07:38,720
<i>Either way, thank goodness...</i>

141
00:07:38,990 --> 00:07:42,310
<i>I figured she slept on it and decided 
she didn't want the ring anymore.</i>

142
00:07:42,310 --> 00:07:44,220
Don't tell me you were afraid I slept on it

143
00:07:44,220 --> 00:07:46,420
and decided I didn't want the ring anymore?

144
00:07:46,420 --> 00:07:47,230
<i>Yikes!</i>

145
00:07:48,420 --> 00:07:50,730
Yu, you just can't get enough of me!

146
00:07:50,730 --> 00:07:53,980
If you like me so much, 
wanna actually go out?

147
00:07:53,980 --> 00:07:56,230
<i>Screw you! Don't underestimate me.</i>

148
00:07:56,230 --> 00:07:58,000
<i>I was prepared to quit school, you know.</i>

149
00:07:58,590 --> 00:07:59,560
Hey, Himari.

150
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,880
I realized that you're the only one for me.

151
00:08:06,140 --> 00:08:09,300
If you're really up for it, 
would you go out with me?

152
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:12,550
<i>Perfect, now for the finisher...</i>

153
00:08:12,710 --> 00:08:14,100
Just kidding!

154
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:16,330
I got you, didn't I?

155
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,060
Whatever.

156
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:24,450
I'm sorry, I got too cocky.

157
00:08:24,930 --> 00:08:29,640
You think you can trick me 
with a phony spiel like that?

158
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,610
Oh yeah.

159
00:08:31,610 --> 00:08:33,240
Go on, I'll catch up with you.

160
00:08:46,450 --> 00:08:48,090
That was a close call!

161
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:50,710
Jeez, Yu. He almost got me.

162
00:08:51,090 --> 00:08:53,420
<i>For a split second, 
I thought he was for real.</i>

163
00:08:53,660 --> 00:08:56,540
<i>I missed the chance to tell him 
that people know he's the creator of You.</i>

164
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:59,970
<i>Or about Enocchi...</i>

165
00:08:57,970 --> 00:09:00,680
Hii-chan, I'm never speaking to you again.

166
00:09:01,300 --> 00:09:02,450
There you are.

167
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,830
Natsume, stop by the teacher's office.

168
00:09:07,350 --> 00:09:09,950
You turned in your midterm 
exams completely blank?!

169
00:09:09,950 --> 00:09:11,680
Keep your voice down!

170
00:09:12,310 --> 00:09:16,450
Not totally blank. I think 
I answered a couple questions.

171
00:09:16,850 --> 00:09:20,020
But I was so tired, I fell asleep.

172
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,870
What happened?

173
00:09:22,050 --> 00:09:24,960
I was so focused on making that piece.

174
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:27,500
Oh... that's why?

175
00:09:27,710 --> 00:09:30,300
They're letting me retake 
the exam this Sunday.

176
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:34,820
If I pass every subject, 
they'll let me off the hook.

177
00:09:37,090 --> 00:09:40,010
We still have some time until Sunday.

178
00:09:40,010 --> 00:09:42,120
It's okay, I'll help you study after school.

179
00:09:42,470 --> 00:09:44,180
Thanks.

180
00:09:45,090 --> 00:09:48,300
By the way, this may not be 
the best time but...

181
00:09:48,300 --> 00:09:48,930
What's up?

182
00:09:49,570 --> 00:09:51,030
People found out that you're behind You.

183
00:09:52,630 --> 00:09:53,780
Is that bad?

184
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,280
It's not like I was 
hiding my face on social media.

185
00:09:56,540 --> 00:09:58,640
Shouldn't you be more worried?

186
00:09:58,640 --> 00:10:01,410
Why? I don't see any issue with it.

187
00:10:01,410 --> 00:10:02,470
I do!

188
00:10:02,470 --> 00:10:05,410
If people find out you 
make those cute accessories,

189
00:10:05,650 --> 00:10:07,870
you'll have a flock of girls around you!

190
00:10:08,630 --> 00:10:10,590
What are you talking about?

191
00:10:10,870 --> 00:10:14,780
What if what happened
 with Enocchi happens again?

192
00:10:14,780 --> 00:10:16,600
Girls could come up to you and ask to model,

193
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:19,210
and you'll go along with it like last time.

194
00:10:19,530 --> 00:10:22,240
Could you not bring that up again?

195
00:10:24,930 --> 00:10:27,120
Listen, Himari.

196
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,350
I'll say it again.

197
00:10:30,180 --> 00:10:31,060
Yeah, what?

198
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:34,360
This ring belongs to you and you only.

199
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:39,260
As long as you keep this, 
you're my number one model.

200
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:49,210
A-Aww, you really can't get... get enough...

201
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:54,950
Ow!

202
00:10:54,950 --> 00:10:56,220
Why did you smack me?!

203
00:10:56,220 --> 00:10:57,340
I heard something pop!

204
00:10:57,590 --> 00:10:59,930
You're being way too cheesy, that's why!

205
00:10:59,930 --> 00:11:01,880
Doesn't give you the right to slap me!

206
00:11:02,090 --> 00:11:04,100
I-It was your fault.

207
00:11:07,590 --> 00:11:09,590
'S-Sup, Enomoto-san?

208
00:11:09,990 --> 00:11:10,970
Taking a break.

209
00:11:11,770 --> 00:11:13,940
R-Right.

210
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:21,360
H-How long have you been 
there? I didn't notice.

211
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:24,940
From when Hii-chan yelled 
about girls flocking to you.

212
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:27,990
Sorry to bother you.

213
00:11:29,380 --> 00:11:32,450
Y-Yu, did something happen with Enocchi?

214
00:11:32,450 --> 00:11:35,260
I could ask you the same.
She's totally avoiding you.

215
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:39,270
<i>Actually, a lot did happen.</i>

216
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:42,720
<i>While Himari and I were fighting.</i>

217
00:11:43,030 --> 00:11:44,220
<i>But I can't say that.</i>

218
00:11:44,870 --> 00:11:48,180
<i>Honestly, the leak is 
a bigger issue than the exams.</i>

219
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:50,890
Yu

220
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:50,890
Himari

221
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:50,890
Enocchi

222
00:11:48,810 --> 00:11:50,880
<i>It's pretty clear who started it.</i>

223
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:53,880
<i>I'll keep Yu to myself as his best friend.</i>

224
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:56,260
<i>And write my own happy ending!</i>

225
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:58,230
<i>No matter what gets in the way.</i>

226
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:01,120
You're quicker than I expected.

227
00:12:01,750 --> 00:12:05,420
Why did you leak that stuff 
about You, after all this time?

228
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:09,060
Is it not obvious?

229
00:12:09,060 --> 00:12:11,760
It's all to help Rin-chan beat you!

230
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,560
<i>No remorse. What an ass!</i>

231
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:18,280
Too bad, but Yu's my best friend.

232
00:12:18,470 --> 00:12:22,920
I like Enocchi, but even if 
she cuts me off, I won't give that up.

233
00:12:23,230 --> 00:12:25,880
You're so desperate.

234
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:29,750
Anyone could tell how you feel about him.

235
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:35,970
Hate to break it to you, 
but this won't go your way.

236
00:12:36,220 --> 00:12:38,880
Yu chose me, and he's loyal—

237
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:40,230
Let me be very clear.

238
00:12:40,470 --> 00:12:45,320
If you really wanted Natsu for yourself, 
you should've taken him to Tokyo.

239
00:12:45,970 --> 00:12:52,370
Natsu was prepared to leave everything 
for you and you weren't.

240
00:12:52,370 --> 00:12:54,760
You decided not to take him 
while you had the chance.

241
00:12:55,670 --> 00:12:57,500
What are you talking about?

242
00:12:57,910 --> 00:12:59,110
You'll see soon enough.

243
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:04,360
Sorry, but you're not even a threat to us.

244
00:13:08,860 --> 00:13:12,210
So how exactly do I study for a make-up exam?

245
00:13:12,590 --> 00:13:14,710
I dunno, but I messaged Onii-chan about it.

246
00:13:14,710 --> 00:13:16,920
I'm sure he'll know what to do.

247
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:20,900
I can't believe you haven't 
visited my place in almost a year.

248
00:13:21,220 --> 00:13:24,400
Yeah, since the start of freshman year.

249
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:26,240
Himari Inuzuka
(My Granddaughter)

250
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:26,240
Yu Natsume
 (My Grandson-in-Law)

251
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,860
Congratulations on
 entering high school!

252
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:33,730
That banner your grandpa made 
was so embarrassing.

253
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:38,780
Oh yeah. Grandpa's staying 
in the hospital right now.

254
00:13:38,780 --> 00:13:43,530
And Mom's giddy to spend the night 
with Dad while he's back in Japan.

255
00:13:43,530 --> 00:13:45,730
So I guess it's just us today.

256
00:13:46,110 --> 00:13:46,470
Take that!

257
00:13:46,470 --> 00:13:46,960
Ow!

258
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,860
I'm not falling for that one.

259
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:50,590
You said Hibari-san would be here.

260
00:13:50,590 --> 00:13:51,600
I gotta say hi.

261
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,540
Onii-chan isn't here either.

262
00:13:54,370 --> 00:13:56,560
But you said he'd help me study.

263
00:13:56,910 --> 00:14:01,930
He sent over a big pile of 
notes and some old practice books.

264
00:14:01,930 --> 00:14:04,320
So I'm gonna help you study 
while looking them over.

265
00:14:04,610 --> 00:14:07,430
Onii-chan's too busy 
with work to be here himself.

266
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:09,190
Oh, okay.

267
00:14:10,250 --> 00:14:12,100
<i>So wait, we're seriously gonna be alone?</i>

268
00:14:16,470 --> 00:14:17,960
Hello, Yu-kun!

269
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:20,500
Welcome back home!

270
00:14:23,730 --> 00:14:24,940
Bwa-ha!

271
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:26,550
Himari!

272
00:14:29,770 --> 00:14:32,640
Now, let's get to work.

273
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:35,100
Hibari-san, what about work?

274
00:14:36,390 --> 00:14:37,520
No worries.

275
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:40,210
I served up one of my staff 
to attend today's conference.

276
00:14:40,410 --> 00:14:41,640
Served up?

277
00:14:42,010 --> 00:14:42,730
Yu-kun.

278
00:14:42,730 --> 00:14:43,860
Y-Yes!

279
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:47,070
I've always been in agreement with Himari.

280
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:51,800
You shine the brightest 
when making accessories.

281
00:14:52,090 --> 00:14:57,730
I believe your work will make this 
town known across the globe one day.

282
00:14:57,730 --> 00:14:59,320
W-Wow, thanks.

283
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:02,830
Which is exactly why I can't 
allow anything to get in your way!

284
00:15:02,830 --> 00:15:05,840
Like studying for exams, for example!

285
00:15:06,130 --> 00:15:09,430
S-Sure, but I'm a student. 
It can't be helped.

286
00:15:09,580 --> 00:15:12,050
There's a way to get out of that.

287
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:18,480
This is your chance to master everything 
there is to know in high school.

288
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:21,770
That way, you'll never have to study 
for an exam ever again.

289
00:15:21,770 --> 00:15:26,690
In fact, I could help you 
enter Japan's best institution!

290
00:15:27,310 --> 00:15:28,450
H-Himari!

291
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:31,600
Y-You said you'd study with me!

292
00:15:32,210 --> 00:15:35,560
There's no stopping Onii-chan 
when he gets fired up like this.

293
00:15:35,830 --> 00:15:37,330
Good luck, Yu!

294
00:15:38,330 --> 00:15:41,010
Let's study with your brother-in-law.

295
00:15:41,010 --> 00:15:42,920
Th-Thanks.

296
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:46,970
Yu, hop in the bath while it's hot.

297
00:15:48,370 --> 00:15:50,950
Sorry about Onii-chan.

298
00:15:51,540 --> 00:15:54,400
He's been real busy lately.

299
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:57,910
I thought he could use 
that to blow off some steam.

300
00:15:58,610 --> 00:16:02,720
It's okay, I'm the one 
who should be thanking him.

301
00:16:02,950 --> 00:16:04,280
You sacrificed me on purpose?

302
00:16:04,280 --> 00:16:04,960
Bwa-ha!

303
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,720
<i>A beauty in a yukata...</i>

304
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:11,860
<i>What accessory would pair well?</i>

305
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:13,390
<i>Something around her neck?</i>

306
00:16:13,390 --> 00:16:14,960
Yu, you're staring.

307
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,160
Oh, sorry.

308
00:16:16,590 --> 00:16:19,660
I was just thinking of what 
accessories would go with that yukata.

309
00:16:20,550 --> 00:16:22,650
I didn't say you can't stare.

310
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:24,370
Cut it out!

311
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:29,540
Wow, it's like a real hot springs inn!

312
00:16:30,050 --> 00:16:34,020
I've visited a few times, but 
I've never stayed the night or taken a bath.

313
00:16:34,870 --> 00:16:36,510
You'll be here again tomorrow anyways.

314
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:38,520
Go ahead and leave your 
clothes in the hamper.

315
00:16:38,810 --> 00:16:41,320
I'll have our helpers wash it.

316
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:43,230
Really? Thanks!

317
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:48,030
<i>Which seat has Himari used?</i>

318
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:50,000
<i>Hold up, what am I thinking?</i>

319
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,100
<i>Am I stupid?</i>

320
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:52,910
Heads up, Yu, I'm opening the door.

321
00:16:56,650 --> 00:16:57,530
Bwa-ha!

322
00:16:57,530 --> 00:16:58,620
Such a virgin.

323
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:00,000
Shut up!

324
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:03,030
I've never had a girl see me naked!

325
00:17:03,030 --> 00:17:04,580
Why did you open the door?

326
00:17:05,530 --> 00:17:08,620
You know, you worked so hard today.

327
00:17:08,620 --> 00:17:10,830
Want me to wash your back for you?

328
00:17:11,590 --> 00:17:13,760
<i>This girl is out of her mind!</i>

329
00:17:14,060 --> 00:17:15,960
Since I couldn't help you study,

330
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,970
maybe you could use some cheering up.

331
00:17:18,320 --> 00:17:20,920
Th-That's weird between opposite genders.

332
00:17:21,150 --> 00:17:23,470
Yeah, but we're best friends.

333
00:17:23,470 --> 00:17:27,670
Or do you actually see me as more than that?

334
00:17:28,150 --> 00:17:29,760
<i>She's just teasing me like usual.</i>

335
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:31,770
<i>I'm not falling for it.</i>

336
00:17:32,940 --> 00:17:34,400
Fine. Could you, please?

337
00:17:36,360 --> 00:17:38,200
O-Okay.

338
00:17:38,380 --> 00:17:40,600
Then let me undress.

339
00:17:41,250 --> 00:17:41,680
Huh?

340
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:45,760
Turn around so you can't see, okay?

341
00:17:46,190 --> 00:17:48,240
<i>But she's just washing my back.</i>

342
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:49,580
<i>There's no need to undress...</i>

343
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:51,590
<i>Wait, that's beside the point.</i>

344
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:55,470
<i>Himari-san? Don't you think 
that's a bit overboard?</i>

345
00:17:57,210 --> 00:17:59,920
Yu, keep your eyes closed.

346
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:00,630
O-Okay!

347
00:18:00,630 --> 00:18:01,540
<i>"Okay"?</i>

348
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:07,810
<i>It's the same arms as the science room...</i>

349
00:18:09,050 --> 00:18:10,030
<i>I can't!</i>

350
00:18:10,030 --> 00:18:13,230
Come on, let me wash you down.

351
00:18:13,230 --> 00:18:15,240
No!

352
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:18,200
Bwa-ha!

353
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:18,200
Himari!

354
00:18:20,070 --> 00:18:23,920
I didn't think it would actually 
go exactly as Himari imagined.

355
00:18:24,250 --> 00:18:27,010
Hibari-san, that wasn't funny.

356
00:18:27,010 --> 00:18:28,620
You're right, I'm sorry.

357
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:33,080
But goodness, are you two 
always fooling around like this?

358
00:18:33,310 --> 00:18:35,080
Uh, well, you see...

359
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:37,810
I always try and stop her.

360
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,620
I mean—nothing's ever happened!

361
00:18:41,170 --> 00:18:45,620
I have no right judging 
how you two act as best friends.

362
00:18:46,150 --> 00:18:49,420
Anyways, I'm glad you two worked things out.

363
00:18:49,610 --> 00:18:50,030
Huh?

364
00:18:50,360 --> 00:18:51,720
I know what happened.

365
00:18:52,130 --> 00:18:54,440
Why wouldn't I know?

366
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:56,130
<i>That's definitely convincing.</i>

367
00:18:56,680 --> 00:19:01,750
I was worried Himari 
wouldn't be able to apologize.

368
00:19:01,750 --> 00:19:04,200
She's been too spoiled growing up.

369
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:06,440
Himari apologize? For what?

370
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:09,630
I thought Himari apologized yesterday.

371
00:19:09,850 --> 00:19:12,360
That's how you two made up, right?

372
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:15,460
<i>Um, we did make up, but...</i>

373
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:18,580
Himari never did anything wrong.

374
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:21,780
I was the one who apologized.
It was my fault.

375
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:23,280
What?

376
00:19:26,430 --> 00:19:28,230
She <i>hasn't</i> apologized.

377
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:29,480
Hibari-san?

378
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:34,460
Do you mind sharing a bit more on that?

379
00:19:34,460 --> 00:19:37,000
<i>My bad, Himari. Didn't mean to out you.</i>

380
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:40,460
Oh my gosh, that was crazy!

381
00:19:40,460 --> 00:19:43,420
If Onii-chan hadn't walked by,

382
00:19:43,420 --> 00:19:45,830
Yu and I would have been in our bath alone!

383
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:52,760
Romance sure does take a toll...

384
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:54,490
<i>But I don't mind, I guess.</i>

385
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:57,690
<i>When Yu claps back like that, 
there's this weird tension in the air.</i>

386
00:19:57,690 --> 00:20:00,200
<i>It's almost like a thrill, it's so exciting.</i>

387
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:02,470
<i>Was I a masochist all along?</i>

388
00:20:05,230 --> 00:20:06,380
<i>Is that Yu?</i>

389
00:20:06,380 --> 00:20:09,310
<i>Oh my gosh, he came to 
a girl's room this late at night!</i>

390
00:20:09,310 --> 00:20:11,530
<i>Could this mean...?</i>

391
00:20:12,260 --> 00:20:14,560
<i>If he's up for it, so am I!</i>

392
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:15,090
Come in!

393
00:20:15,090 --> 00:20:18,510
<i>It'd make things weirder 
if I pushed him away, right?</i>

394
00:20:20,220 --> 00:20:22,950
Himari, let's have a little chat.

395
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:25,000
Shall we?

396
00:20:26,870 --> 00:20:32,640
Yu-kun, when it comes 
to studying, repetition is key.

397
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:35,560
You got a pretty good 
grasp of things yesterday,

398
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:38,750
so let's take mock exams as many 
times as possible until Sunday.

399
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:40,120
O-Okay.

400
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:42,230
Thank you. By the way...

401
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:43,530
And another thing.

402
00:20:44,150 --> 00:20:48,440
Lack of sleep is your biggest enemy.

403
00:20:48,770 --> 00:20:52,700
Feel free to use my 
favorite relaxation items.

404
00:20:52,700 --> 00:20:54,060
G-Great.

405
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:56,460
<i>The Inuzuka Family specialty:</i>

406
00:20:56,460 --> 00:20:58,480
<i>kill them with kindness.</i>

407
00:20:58,930 --> 00:21:00,810
See you tonight.

408
00:21:00,810 --> 00:21:01,960
Thank you.

409
00:21:04,120 --> 00:21:05,740
Himari, you okay?

410
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:08,910
Yeah, now that Onii-chan's gone.

411
00:21:09,510 --> 00:21:10,880
I'm better now.

412
00:21:11,110 --> 00:21:12,080
Yu-kun.

413
00:21:13,490 --> 00:21:14,440
Good morning.

414
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:16,370
H-Hey, Enomoto-san...

415
00:21:16,370 --> 00:21:18,560
'S-Sup, Enocchi?

416
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:21,230
<i>Is she some kind of modern ninja?</i>

417
00:21:21,230 --> 00:21:25,520
Yu-kun, did you just get 
out of a car with Hii-chan?

418
00:21:25,520 --> 00:21:27,960
U-Um, Hibari-san was just dropping us off.

419
00:21:28,430 --> 00:21:30,460
I stayed at Himari's place last nigh—

420
00:21:31,550 --> 00:21:33,800
You stayed at <i>Hii-chan</i>'s house?

421
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:37,140
Um, it's nothing. No big deal.

422
00:21:37,710 --> 00:21:39,970
I was studying with 
Hibari-san the entire time.

423
00:21:39,970 --> 00:21:41,620
Studying? For what?

424
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:44,260
I have to retake my exams on Sunday.

425
00:21:44,610 --> 00:21:47,740
I can't move to the next 
grade without passing.

426
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:55,040
Then I'll come, too.

427
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:59,000
I'll stay the night, too!

428
00:23:35,260 --> 00:23:39,980
The Scent of Cherry Sage

